ty</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left;padding:4px 16px 4px 0;white-space:nowrap'>1</td><td style='text-align:left;padding:4px 16px 4px 0;white-space:nowrap'>Paris</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left;padding:4px 16px 4px 0;white-space:nowrap'>2</td><td style='text-align:left;padding:4px 16px 4px 0;white-space:nowrap'>Oslo</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left;padding:4px 16px 4px 0;white-space:nowrap'>3</td><td style='text-align:left;padding:4px 16px 4px 0;white-space:nowrap'>Paris</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><marimo-callout-output data-html='&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eAfter 0 batch(es): the maintained view &#92;u003cstrong&#92;u003eequals&#92;u003c/strong&#92;u003e full recomputation \u2713. Each batch runs 3 Lean-generated update plans on DuckDB.&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;' data-kind='&quot;success&quot;'></marimo-callout-output></div>"
